  "title": "Q2 selection phase M2M3: RF permutation importance + partial correlation + Borda/Jaccard/prior/plausibility",
  "assumptions": [
    "Package bare keys r2/r2_overall are placeholders: r2 = mean cross-method Top-3 Jaccard (0-1), r2_overall = same for the overall dim; Q2 has no per-sample prediction task, documented in params.metricNote",
    "M3 primary estimator is Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage joint precision (protocol-allowed regularized joint precision); GraphicalLassoCV alpha-inner-CV collapses to 99.94% exact-zero partial correlations and is kept only as sensitivity with the degeneracy recorded",
    "6.csv is loaded only after all selection scores and Borda aggregation are computed; it never enters M1-M4 or the Top-3 ordering",
    "Borda tie-break: mean rank, then M4 rank, then column index (deterministic)",
    "All conclusions are cross-sectional associations, not causal effects"
  ],
  "equations": [
    "M2: PI_j = mean over 5 folds and 3 repeats of [MSE(permute x_j on validation) - MSE(baseline)]",
    "M3: partial corr = -Theta_jk / sqrt(Theta_jj Theta_kk), Theta = regularized joint precision",
    "Borda: mean rank over M1..M4; final Top-3 = 3 smallest mean ranks",
    "Jaccard(A,B) = |A cap B| / |A cup B| for Top-3 sets per dim",
    "confidence = #{methods m: compound in Top3_m}; grades 4/4, 3/4, <=2/4"
  ],
  "algorithm": "Stage M2M3 + aggregation of the 4-method Q2 importance protocol. M2: per-dim RandomForest (200 trees, max_features=0.33, min_samples_leaf=2) 5-fold CV; importance = mean validation-fold permutation importance (3 repeats, vectorized batch prediction), NOT impurity. M3: Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage joint precision matrix over [231 features + 50 targets]; importance = |partial correlation|. GraphicalLassoCV (alpha inner CV) is computed as a sensitivity and its degenerate behaviour is recorded in outputs/q2/m3_diagnostics.json. Then: Borda rank aggregation (sum of 4 method ranks) -> consensus Top-3; pairwise Top-3 Jaccard (6 pairs/dim); confidence grading (how many of 4 methods place each consensus compound in its Top-3: 4/4, 3/4, <=2/4); independent prior check vs 6.csv |r| (Spearman per dim, loaded only after selection); chemical plausibility vs pre-registered expectations + 8.xlsx origin_paper/thresholds/OAV; M4-only bootstrap B=100 as a quick top3_stability proxy (full 4-method B=300/B=20 bootstrap in q2_stability phases).",
